{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the coefficient of the fourth term of the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/8/7b84a1272fd8c2d1288ecbfa77fb4c5d8b84dbf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The coefficient of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term in the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/640ce5a5ca89bf3b851c381bfe15d81526db9b4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/30363c05d8838c11a649fbb141e4a59100858092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(m,n - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a6e59e87510201d2cf3d980a927eba4f795ebd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" /> represents the binomial coefficient.\n</p><p>Therefore, the fourth term of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f6fa8f5e96b6d52f21162d391144685d7fad294.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + y)^{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"21\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/7/637d8947f06beccf178a3a0b6a853d3f8067d2ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(15, 4 - 1) = C(15, 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"20\" />. This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782d0df4785aec8a5b19912dbac3f8f0705c5f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(15, 3) = \\frac{15 \\times 14 \\times 13}{3 \\times 2 \\times 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/7/2a77c9d994a0e7bf4ee1a07bee543f532538a260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=5 \\times 7 \\times 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/d/32d9559a9111ef0363b09da35bfead7aa304374c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=5 \\times 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/5/16592446fae9e60d36c05a4240ee7cad85e25317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{455}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~edited by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2005 iTest Pro